desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "general"
	title: "Deprecated Use Bitwise"
	title_zh: "Deprecated Use Bitwise"
	type: audit
	level: middle
	rule_id: "source-best-practice-deprecated_use_bitwise"
	risk: "Best Practice"
	desc: <<<DESC
Migrated from Semgrep rule `deprecated_use_bitwise` (elixir/lang/best-practice/deprecated-use-bitwise.yaml).
Original message: The syntax `use Bitwise` is already deprecated. Please use `import Bitwise` instead.
References:
- https://github.com/elixir-lang/elixir/commit/f1b9d3e818e5bebd44540f87be85979f24b9abfc
Note: source-mode regex approximation of a safe-literal Semgrep pattern.
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
Preferred fix: import Bitwise
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://pos.ex": <<<POS
use Bitwise
POS
	"safefile://pos.ex": <<<NEG
import Bitwise
NEG
)

${*.ex}.pattern_regex(/(?:use\s+Bitwise)/) as $p0
${*.exs}.pattern_regex(/(?:use\s+Bitwise)/) as $p1
$p0 + $p1 as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "middle",
	title: "Deprecated Use Bitwise",
	title_zh: "Deprecated Use Bitwise",
	message: "Deprecated Use Bitwise detected.",
}
